{title: Entre tus manos}

[E]Entre Tus[F#m] mano[B7]s estä mi vid[G#m]a, Senor.
En[C#m]tre Tus m[F#m]anos[B7] pongo mi e[E]xistir.
H[E7]ay que mor[AB7]ir, para[E] vivi[G#m]r.
En[C#m]tre Tus [F#m]manos[B7] confio [E]mi[A] se[E]r
(Estrofas)

Si el g[F#m]rano [B7]de trigo [E]no mu[G#m]ere,

Pe[C#m]ro si m[F#m]uere [B7]en ab[E]undanci[G#m]a darä
Un[C#m] fruto et[F#m]erno [B7]que no m[E]ori[A]rá
